  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation: Mentorship, Capacity Building and tackling harmful traditional practices.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project will aim at strengthening public sector health systems capacity to deliver maternal health services, offer mentorship of health workers on family planning and Maternal Child Health as well as Tackling traditional harmful practices, myths and misinformation about Family Planning.</narrative>
  </description>
